PREFIX  owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX  dc:   <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/>

SELECT  (COUNT(DISTINCT ?company) AS ?countCompanies)
WHERE
  {   { ?company  rdf:type              <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Company> ;
                  <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/regionServed>  <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Australia>
      }
    UNION
      { ?company  <http://dbpedia.org/property/headquarters>  <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Klang_Valley> ;
                  <http://dbpedia.org/property/country>  ?country .
        ?country  rdf:type              <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Country>
      }
    UNION
      { ?company  rdf:type              <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Company> ;
                  <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/locationCity>  <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Texas>
      }
  }

messages:
```SELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?company) AS ?countCompanies) WHERE {
  {
    ?company a <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Company> ;
             <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/regionServed> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Australia> .
  }
  UNION
  {
    ?company <http://dbpedia.org/property/headquarters> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Klang_Valley> ;
             <http://dbpedia.org/property/country> ?country .
    ?country a <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Country> .
  }
  UNION
  {
    ?company a <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Company> ;
             <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/locationCity> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Texas> .
  }
}
```

